  "note": "v4 held-out (30): unchanged from v3 -- both new probe cases (p01, p02) are in dev. HONEST LIMITATION: both probes were run during the build (that is how the daily-series turn was verified), so like v1-v3, v4 held-out means 'held out from fixes', not pristine. Truly fresh held-out cases (designed without probing) have not arrived yet. The 120/30 target split is exceeded at 152 cases (122 dev / 30 held-out).",
